scenario: async-normal-close
A         committed SET search_path; insert left uncommitted                                   done
A         close()                                                                              returned
observer  A's uncommitted insert after close                                                   not visible
B         same physical session as A                                                           True
B         search_path                                                                          tenant_a, public
observer  where B's committed insert landed                                                    tenant_a
observer  A's insert after B's commit                                                          not visible
